antissant ainsi une rentabilité sécurisée par bail commercial.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\n\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"27 boulevard Marechal juin","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjAzOTBjNTc3OTdlNTQ2NGZmOWJiYzQxZmVkZDdlZWM0N2Q4ZWY3ZGYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5Njg4MGExYzJhYmRkNDJkYzY0NThlYzJiMTFjYTBmYyJ9?signature=4a40ad0bc7171044a77d34615419e463f82571fcf5d00fc7ba68f251e6307b45","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjgyMTAxOTU5ZmYyYzRjNGIzYTg4YTUyODY1MzRlN2EzYzY2MDE0MTUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2ZWEwMjI0NjhkZTRkY2Q4OGY2NGNkY2MzMWQyOWE2ZSJ9?signature=c1c674187412bd3d05e376157e63d6f5370dd349c3ab1eba9f626048b5246c35","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc2ZjRhM2NhZWFiYTk4MjYxY2I2ZDVlYjdjOWYzYjAyNDlhYTM3ZWQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiYjg2NzllZTU3MjRiZGZmMDc3YmU0ODA1ZDhjZDc1MSJ9?signature=e4d5fe0d828704e25e422fa694e5fd1048d023d019d6683c23638b0e486c5045","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQ5YzBkZjdmOTlhMzA1NGFmZTIzM2U1YmRjZGZmNTFmNDM4NDgxMTYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkNTM1MzcxOTMyYTJlNjllMjdmOTRkZjllZmUxZDU3MiJ9?signature=a8f7cb2f2014575ddcb9636688a7070396b7a91820877d227c553ab02807c050","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc0MzgzY2Y0ZDBhMGFhMDExZWE5ZTRmNGQzM2M3MmNhNjA0Y2Y3M2YiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4ZTZkZD